@host = http://localhost:5080
@customer = d0474d9a-d3ed-433c-a5d0-f79585222e12
@article = 30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@articleStore = 40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004

### Catálogo
GET {{host}}/api/articles

### Favoritos del cliente (lista de ids de artículo)
GET {{host}}/api/customers/{{customer}}/favourites

### Marcar favorito (idempotente)
PUT {{host}}/api/customers/{{customer}}/favourites/{{article}}

### Quitar favorito
DELETE {{host}}/api/customers/{{customer}}/favourites/{{article}}

### Ver carrito
GET {{host}}/api/customers/{{customer}}/cart

### Guardar carrito (sustituye el contenido completo)
PUT {{host}}/api/customers/{{customer}}/cart
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lines": [
    { "articleStoreId": "{{articleStore}}", "quantity": 3 }
  ]
}

### Vaciar carrito
DELETE {{host}}/api/customers/{{customer}}/cart

### Esquema OpenAPI
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
